    "A profile JSON bundles your OpenBao URL, TLS certificate, JWT auth settings, and optional SSH target (`bao-buddy export-profile --copy`)." : {
      "comment" : "Setup footer. Do not translate the command in backticks.",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "يجمع ملف تعريف JSON عنوان URL الخاص بـ OpenBao وشهادة TLS وإعدادات مصادقة JWT وهدف SSH الاختياري (`bao-buddy export-profile --copy`)."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ein Profil-JSON bündelt deine OpenBao-URL, dein TLS-Zertifikat, die JWT-Auth-Einstellungen und ein optionales SSH-Ziel (`bao-buddy export-profile --copy`)."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Un perfil JSON agrupa tu URL de OpenBao, tu certificado TLS, la configuración de autenticación JWT y un destino SSH opcional (`bao-buddy export-profile --copy`)."
          }
        },
        "es-419" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Un perfil JSON agrupa tu URL de OpenBao, tu certificado TLS, la configuración de autenticación JWT y un destino SSH opcional (`bao-buddy export-profile --copy`)."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Un profil JSON regroupe votre URL OpenBao, votre certificat TLS, vos réglages d’authentification JWT et une cible SSH facultative (`bao-buddy export-profile --copy`)."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Un profilo JSON raggruppa URL di OpenBao, certificato TLS, impostazioni di autenticazione JWT e destinazione SSH facoltativa (`bao-buddy export-profile --copy`)."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "プロファイル JSON には、OpenBao の URL、TLS 証明書、JWT 認証設定、およびオプションの SSH ターゲットがまとめられています（`bao-buddy export-profile --copy`）。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "프로파일 JSON에는 OpenBao URL, TLS 인증서, JWT 인증 설정 및 선택 사항인 SSH 대상이 포함됩니다(`bao-buddy export-profile --copy`)."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Een profiel-JSON bundelt je OpenBao-URL, TLS-certificaat, JWT-authenticatie-instellingen en optioneel SSH-doel (`bao-buddy export-profile --copy`)."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Profil JSON zawiera adres URL OpenBao, certyfikat TLS, ustawienia uwierzytelniania JWT i opcjonalny cel SSH (`bao-buddy export-profile --copy`)."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Um perfil JSON reúne a URL do OpenBao, o certificado TLS, os ajustes de autenticação JWT e o destino SSH opcional (`bao-buddy export-profile --copy`)."
          }
        },
        "pt-PT" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Um perfil JSON agrupa o URL do OpenBao, o certificado TLS, as definições de autenticação JWT e o destino SSH opcional (`bao-buddy export-profile --copy`)."
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "En profil-JSON samlar din OpenBao-URL, ditt TLS-certifikat, inställningar för JWT-autentisering och ett valfritt SSH-mål (`bao-buddy export-profile --copy`)."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Profil JSON dosyası; OpenBao URL'nizi, TLS sertifikanızı, JWT kimlik doğrulama ayarlarınızı ve isteğe bağlı SSH hedefinizi bir araya getirir (`bao-buddy export-profile --copy`)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
